WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Snap. Your screen. In full flow.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.500
Uploads. Start with what you have. Drag in media. Drop it into your timeline.

00:08.500 --> 00:14.500
Motion. Let the camera follow. Auto zoom · motion blur · camera curves

00:14.500 --> 00:19.000
Cursor. Give every click character. Custom cursors. Smooth paths. Click effects.

00:19.000 --> 00:25.000
Canvas. Make the canvas yours. Custom gradients · solid colors · wallpapers

00:25.000 --> 00:29.500
3D Tilt. Add another dimension. 3D tilt, perspective, and animated poses.

00:29.500 --> 00:35.000
Color. Find your signature look. Film looks · color correction · RGB curves

00:35.000 --> 00:39.500
Audio. Get the balance right. Tune system audio and microphone independently.

00:39.500 --> 00:44.000
Captions. Put your words on screen. Generate local captions. Edit every line.

00:44.000 --> 00:48.000
Layers. Point out what matters. Text, shapes, spotlights, and masks.

00:48.000 --> 00:51.500
Actions. Make the steps clear. Show recorded keys and clicks as you go.

00:51.500 --> 00:56.000
Motion. Fine-tune every move. Timeline keyframes. Easing. Camera curves.

00:56.000 --> 01:00.000
Make it a Snap. Every detail. Your way. Free for Windows. snap.venusapp.in
